  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/739/578/title.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@FurtiTwo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1224/985/youtube-png.png\" width=\"19%\" height=\"19%\"></a><a href=\"https://discord.gg/k3fGJwJqzu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1224/987/discord-png.png\" width=\"19%\" height=\"19%\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252ffurtitwo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1224/988/donate-png.png\" width=\"22%\" height=\"22%\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/furti_two/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1224/986/curseforge-png.png\" width=\"19%\" height=\"19%\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252ffurti-two\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1224/984/modrinth-png.png\" width=\"19%\" height=\"19%\"></a></p><p><strong>「霜凍朋友」模組新增了冷藏物品！它還讓你能親手製作自己的雪人，只需要一層雪就可以開始製作！你只需要將雪滾成球，然後用鏟子收集雪堆，最後把它們堆疊起來！你還可以用種子、胡蘿蔔和其他配件來個性化你的霜凍朋友！</strong></p><p>（安裝 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">JEI</a> 以查看所有配方）</p><p>我是法國人，這個模組是用 Mcreator 製作的。</p><p>該模組新增了雪鏟，可以讓你一次清除 3x3 範圍內的雪：<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/739/579/image1.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>雪堆、雪丘和雪墩：</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/739/580/image2.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>以下是製作你自己的雪人的方法：</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>以下是雪人的不同部件：</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/739/581/image3.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>以下是不同的組合可能性：</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/739/582/image4.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/739/583/image5.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/739/583/image5.png</a></p><p>你可以親自戴上雪人的帽子：<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/739/583/image5.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;冰箱可以讓你在不必前往特定生態域的情況下，透過右鍵點擊來製造冰和雪：</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/739/584/image6.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p>使用這個模組，當你破壞冰時，你會收集到冰塊：<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/739/585/image7.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p>你可以用壓縮冰塊製作工具：<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/739/586/image8.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>你可以將此模組放入你的模組包中。&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><div>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">你也可以看看我的其他模組：</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/useless-sword\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/465/416/64/64/637746702745178325.png\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mutated-items\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1070/646/64/64/638606054091700999.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stalwart-dungeons\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/531/588/64/64/637853847063684188.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/seeds\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/811/657/638184557398425576.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/organics\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/465/413/64/64/637746699816017646.png\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/slimy-stuff\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1076/873/64/64/638614825744489631.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nethers-exoticism\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/724/578/64/64/638077506455486007.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/frosted-friends\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/465/411/64/64/637746696852738455.png\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wandering-bags\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/689/759/64/64/638069994452394564.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/alexs-caves-torpedoes\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/973/674/64/64/638476410476119618.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/depth\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/811/720/638184653709126308.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/call-of-yucutan\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1002/886/64/64/638523299285638581.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enders-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/779/326/64/64/638124003553252444.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sons-of-sins\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1052/109/sons_of_sins_logo_bis.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-confectionery\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1158/779/64/64/638727280864889757.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-stuff-additions\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1158/714/64/64/638727221391013276.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-logistics\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1116/69/64/64/638670333200272317.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/armor-weight\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/734/378/64/64/638084439152506136.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamo\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/973/774/64/64/638476553282271633.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ninjaxxs-needs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/549/392/64/64/637886561525247638.png\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fuzes-relics\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/580/980/64/64/637945482784615684.png\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">-</p>\n</div>",
